  "body": "Follow-up to #1543 (PR #1564 merged on its old head 42c36dd1 while its review fixes were in progress; they land here). Fork synced at v0.19.0; branched from upstream/main 2d15a617.\n\n## What changed\n- `authored_law(src)` in `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`: `Entity | Selection -> DepthLaw::Section`, `Stock -> None`. The `depth_law_of` arm is `OpParams::Slot { .. } | OpParams::Circular { .. } => authored_law(src)`, still after the `part_solid` early return, so a Stock source cuts unjudged. The Slot is unchanged (a part-solid source was already Section; slot_picks / slot_caps / slot_pick_refusals pass).\n- **#1550:** a picked Circular cut below its picked floor was unjudged end to end - with a rotated stock the program sim refuses to judge and `uncovered()` accepted the op's empty verdict. It now carries blocking gouges on the op and the post refuses.\n- Doc comments, `authored_law_tests.rs` (incl. Slot cases) and `docs/decisions/1543-circular-entity-law.md` describe the shared law; the decision file carries the measured chord-sag table on an R10 hole (32 chords refused up to leave 0.02, 48 up to 0.01, 64 at leave 0, 96+ never).\n\n## Pins\n- `crates/app/tests/circular_pick_law.rs`: a R15 pocket floor at Z4 picked, cut to Z1, stock turned 90° - 3079 gouges on the op, `post_setup` refuses (\"C1: move N cuts past the finish surface\"), no file written; MCP parity via `set_operation_geometry` + verify; the same ring at the floor stays clean; `a_circle_picked_off_the_stock_is_never_judged` (M3).\n- `crates/app/tests/circular_entity_law.rs` (from #1564): an entity-source wall cut gouges and never posts; a legal one is clean.\n\n| mutation | integration | law table |\n|---|---|---|\n| M1 Entity→None | red (wall + MCP) | red |\n| M2 Selection→None | red (rotated-stock + MCP) | red |\n| M3 Circular arm above `part_solid` | red | red |\n| M4 Entity→Contain | survives (same gouge verdicts in every probed case) | red |\n| M5 Stock→Section | unreachable by design | red |\n\nGoldens unchanged: golden_cl 32, solid_law_goldens 7; circular_pick, mill2d_b, units_in_refusals pass.\n\n## Gate\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` green on 1515ba59 (app 775 s, ui 19 s, 0 failed); `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets --no-deps -- -D warnings` clean.\n\n## Not exercised\nA tilted-frame (`Some(frame)`) Circular is refused at generate (reviewer-checked) but has no dedicated pin.\n\nChangelog: A Circular whose picked floor (or whole-model source) it would cut below is now judged against the model: the gouge is reported on the operation and the post is refused (#1550, #1543).\nEffort: high (no escalation)\n\nFixes #1550\nRefs #1543\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
